      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/11/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The issue is hereby authorized of a sum not exceeding twenty billion one hundred and fifty-three million six hundred and seventy nine thousand and nine hundred and ninety-seven ringgit (RM20,153,679,997) from the Consolidated Fund for expenditure on the services and purposes specified in the Schedule for the year 2008, not provided for or not fully provided for by the Supply Act 2008 [Act A1321]. Bill"
      }
    },
    {
